    "---\n",
    "## 5. Task 3.2 — Auxiliary Load Balancing Loss (Switch Transformer)\n",
    "\n",
    "Fedus et al. 2021: evita que el router concentre todo el tráfico en 1-2 expertos.\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{aux}} = \\alpha \\cdot N \\cdot \\sum_{i=1}^{N} f_i \\cdot P_i$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- $f_i$: fracción de tokens ruteados al experto $i$ (hard, via argmax)\n",
    "- $P_i$: probabilidad promedio del router para el experto $i$ (soft)\n",
    "- Óptimo: $f_i \\approx P_i \\approx 1/N$ (uniforme)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 154,
   "id": "b04e62e3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
